  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 6th level, a mountebank gains a +1 bonus to the spell’s save DC when she casts a spell that affects any foe who would be denied a Dexterity bonus to AC (whether the target actually has a Dexterity bonus or not). This bonus increases by +1 at 12th and 18th level.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mountebank#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
